  <item>
    <title>Day 10 我所相信的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6695534337236c546e5de8ee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6695534337236c546e5de8ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jul 2024 16:50:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这一期播客的主题是发现自我信念，不妨问问自己，关于“me”，你到底有多少觉察呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 每日自我肯定：我置身在爱之中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a> You are what you repeat.&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 这两句话，你心里常常想的是哪一句？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 坚信这种信念，那么你的世界就会变成这样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 我们也是父母的一面镜子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 当下的力量：多说几百遍也不为过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 你选择了怎样的思想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> 我承认我过去有这四种习惯，你呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a> Ending肯定语</span></p><span></span><p><span>智慧和知识的大门永远开启着，我相信这种力量和智慧，我需要知道的一切都已被揭示，我所需要的一切都会到来。在正确的时间、地点，按照正确的顺序。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj0vESkylxtSf1DVPDkWdLHP9j75.m4a" length="53041029" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9ikDJv-jnh2wFPmq1BMOyXJPm1.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Day9 积极的自我宣言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6692c34f37236c546eeee0b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6692c34f37236c546eeee0b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jul 2024 18:11:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期想要跟大家聊聊关于改变的自我宣言与爱的自我肯定</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>[时间轴]</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 2024年我可以为自己做的好事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 2024年我想做哪些去年没做的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 2024年我想放下哪些去年紧抓不放的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 我想对自己的生活做出哪些改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 勇敢的新定义： 怕也要去做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 拥抱世界的多样性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> 我愿意努力为自己带来哪些改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 多跟自己对话，追问自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 给改变多一点耐心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 爱的自我肯定宣言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> &nbsp;改变的自我肯定宣言</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmWrJVxHStfhehhGNSn1oT48q8Pt.m4a" length="22591384" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUgUt96UgpdgoKGkTw4zwgYvwGt.jpg"/>
